  "effect_layers": {
    "grade_identity": "(faith_id, holy_site_full_id): regular/eminent is a Faith relationship, not a global site grade.",
    "activation_identity": "The site has one global cached Active/rarity pair. The known rarity producer uses county-holder Faith association/recognition; do not invent one cache per associated Faith.",
    "local": "The two declared local families are regular/eminent eligible, but actual fixed-local title-family contributions and county-scaled production require Active. Title inputs are restricted native families, not all same-Faith characters and not a guessed holder-equals-actor shortcut.",
    "faith_wide": "Actual24FB270 includes only sites eminent for the receiving Rite Faith and passing2441F30 county-holder-Faith equality. Its complete primary has no Site+18 Active gate. Scaled expressions still evaluate against exact HolySite scope; do not turn this into an unqualified live fixed-value claim.",
    "parameters": "These three types declare no parameters. Other types use separately consumed parameter triggers; changing grade does not create an undeclared parameter.",
    "source_info_holder_faith_condition": "S01 line33 says barony holder, but the actual2441F30 consumer resolves barony -> county -> county holder -> current Rite Faith. The executable consumer is the precise controlling-Faith test for this build.",
    "description_is_not_application": "2659880 suppresses the complete ActiveEffects description while Site+18=false; this does not prove that the different actual Faith-wide fixed producer contributed zero."
  },
